shortdesc The Alfa Slab One font face with support for LaTeX and pdfLaTeX
longdesc The alfaslabone package supports the Alfa Slab One font face
longdesc for LaTeX. There is only a Regular font face. It's useful for
longdesc book-chapter headlines.
